@SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Register New User (Default Viewer Role)
POST {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student_researcher",
  "email": "student@sentinellog.local",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!#"
}

###

### 3. Login as Admin (Seed Account)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!#Sentinel"
}

###

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Login as Security Analyst (Seed Account)
# @name analystLogin
POST {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "analyst",
  "password": "Analyst123!#Sentinel"
}

###

@analystToken = {{analystLogin.response.body.token}}

### 5. Login as Service Agent (Seed Account)
# @name serviceLogin
POST {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "service-agent",
  "password": "Service123!#Sentinel"
}

###

@serviceToken = {{serviceLogin.response.body.token}}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Admin)
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Ingest Security Event (Service Agent or Analyst)
# @name ingestEvent
POST {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: sentinel-trace-demo-1001

{
  "eventType": "UnauthorizedAccessAttempt",
  "severity": "High",
  "source": "waf-edge-router",
  "actorId": 1,
  "ipAddress": "198.51.100.77",
  "userAgent": "AutomatedScanner/2.4",
  "resource": "/api/v1/admin/debug",
  "description": "Port scanning probe directed against administrative route.",
  "timestamp": "2026-09-20T12:30:00Z",
  "metadata": {
    "protocol": "HTTP/2",
    "blocked": true,
    "firewallRuleId": "RULE_BLOCK_PRIVILEGED_PROBE"
  }
}

###

@createdEventId = {{ingestEvent.response.body.id}}

### 8. Retrieve Paginated Security Events (With Filters & Whitelisted Sorting)
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events?severity=High&page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=timestamp&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Search Security Events by Keyword
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events?search=scanning&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get Security Event Details By ID
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events/{{createdEventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Get Aggregated Security Event Statistics
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Get Daily Security Event Timeline Breakdown
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/events/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Query Immutable Audit Logs (Admin / Analyst Only)
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Get Audit Log by ID
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 15. User Management: List System Users (Admin Only)
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 16. User Management: Get User Details by ID (Admin Only)
GET {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 17. User Management: Deactivate User Account (Admin Only)
PATCH {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/4/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### 18. User Management: Update User Security Role (Admin Only)
PATCH {{SentinelLog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/4/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 2
}
